; vitest@4 + npm 10.9.7 = "Cannot read properties of null (reading edgesOut)" on a fresh, lockfile-less
; install (bisected 2026-09-10: drop any other devDependency and it still crashes; drop vitest and it
; installs clean). Legacy resolution is the whole workaround. DELETE THIS FILE once a plain
; `rm -rf node_modules && npm install && npm test` succeeds without it — it also hides real peer
; conflicts while it is here, which is the price.
legacy-peer-deps=true
